          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo odwoko Samwiri ni, “Ey, atimo reco; akiwinjo or pa Rwoth kodi wac perin. To oyido alworo jolweny paran, t'atimo gim'oyido jomito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "T'onyo pama akwayin, cwaki ran reco paran aka adoki kodin ŋey anyal lamo Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
